{"questionUid":"qid_v1_a6ceeb35b7ba09a5b00052f47c6b595650b768aea85ae5008b3e5899db678bb0","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_금당중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":18,"sourceQuestionNo":"18","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_금당중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#18","sourceFingerprint":"85179a21cf3c0778f6787281e13df766e0842de8ce47cd10b30ac5db5eab3fcb","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"d4e1fcf0987520dc08fce122d0d5cdddad7734accb3ac533ddac3ffecad1cae1","content":"아래 그림에서 $\\overline{BC}=\\overline{EF}$일 때, 두 가지 조건을 추가하여 $\\triangle ABC\\equiv\\triangle DEF$가 되도록 하려고 한다. 다음 중 이때 필요한 조건이 아닌 것은? (4점)","choices":["$\\angle A=\\angle D$, $\\angle B=\\angle E$","$\\overline{AB}=\\overline{DE}$, $\\angle B=\\angle E$","$\\overline{CA}=\\overline{FD}$, $\\angle C=\\angle F$","$\\overline{AB}=\\overline{DE}$, $\\overline{AC}=\\overline{DF}$","$\\overline{AC}=\\overline{DF}$, $\\angle A=\\angle D$"],"answer":"⑤","solution":"이미 $\\overline{BC}=\\overline{EF}$가 주어져 있다. ①은 ASA, ②와 ③은 SAS, ④는 SSS 합동 조건이 된다. ⑤는 두 변과 그 사이의 각이 아닌 각이 주어진 경우이므로 합동이 보장되지 않는다. 따라서 정답은 ⑤이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_금당중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q18.png","exists":true,"sha256":"6a692cc543993dd097085df17a61e1192dcadccc44badcd443c759b1f6d00000"}],"contentHash":"79bf98ca24cbd33470e795b3438e2b65110dab2e85652fa37db782d96e28bbbd","choicesHash":"1ccb900c61abff669f8432a8fed75e11752b771a739ef0cf6146fbdb6ed42972","solutionHash":"f239c9b628d0c1f1f9ade12ca7d1de063750f698afbb757f4800554f4448e7ba","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"564d92a6c078ccaf207a9dd2c1505ffddf4270ba42f072cac1e705e5099141ab"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_c9a477acd78ede0dce4978e6cfeb2363c7bf2674a48bc870b16aa5a2f5123b91","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_금당중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":19,"sourceQuestionNo":"19","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_금당중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#19","sourceFingerprint":"d8df4466bf7d6b79cd7fbd1d0b5476136ded0dedf150320c017dd1e8865d83e1","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"e8d313884e0cd16443a222fa327165346b2be164b986d10c232ccf6538d83479","content":"오른쪽 그림과 같은 정사각형 $ABCD$에서 $\\overline{EB}=\\overline{FC}$이고, $\\angle CDF=15^{\\circ}$일 때, $\\angle DCE$의 크기는? (4점)","choices":["$75^{\\circ}$","$70^{\\circ}$","$65^{\\circ}$","$60^{\\circ}$","$55^{\\circ}$"],"answer":"①","solution":"$ABCD$가 정사각형이므로 $\\overline{BC}=\\overline{CD}$이고 $\\angle EBC=\\angle FCD=90^{\\circ}$이다. 또 $\\overline{EB}=\\overline{FC}$이므로 $\\triangle EBC\\equiv\\triangle FCD$ (SAS)이다. 따라서 $\\angle BCE=\\angle CDF=15^{\\circ}$이다. $\\angle BCD=90^{\\circ}$이므로 $\\angle DCE=90-15=75^{\\circ}$이다. 정답은 ①이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_금당중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q19.png","exists":true,"sha256":"897dbe8863143bb1d342e034bd8418a931f3e67fc048d18ac22300c44bb2a5db"}],"contentHash":"08fd697aaf72486af088fd40bc10c6c6d151e0d09e8a82db7af7ca08189ff7a6","choicesHash":"4c45458a2c028a86b799a9dc2520785e84b823d05a0f4d8dad4de22163b4efd1","solutionHash":"d5799142ce80d797fc21cb22667875f73c170f3573f7c836adb759a6633c31c4","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"cbbec5b2181f60d7df972c3b039a8dc1897925a5ed209cb16ee5fa9601d5238b"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_b47f2fc2289348b787e2f71a5ae1d786c327cd82781026dbeeeb03c90304b6ae","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_금당중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":20,"sourceQuestionNo":"20","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_금당중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#20","sourceFingerprint":"3d4bfe69d90124ed09aa92a1f2b43bb4d630896c2feadac1da19bab9c0cdcd28","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"a954637c8a1c8702f7a3db63a6a543522ad27ed804a873083c7daffd667ed628","content":"오른쪽 그림에서 $\\triangle ABC$와 $\\triangle CDE$는 정삼각형이고 $\\angle DBE=70^{\\circ}$일 때, $\\angle x$의 크기는? (5점)","choices":["$100^{\\circ}$","$110^{\\circ}$","$120^{\\circ}$","$130^{\\circ}$","$135^{\\circ}$"],"answer":"④","solution":"$\\triangle ABC$와 $\\triangle CDE$는 정삼각형이므로 $AC=BC$, $CD=CE$, $\\angle BCA=\\angle DCE=60^{\\circ}$이다. 따라서 $\\angle ACD=\\angle BCE$이고, $\\triangle ACD\\equiv\\triangle BCE$ (SAS)이다. 그러므로 $\\angle CAD=\\angle CBE$이다. $\\angle CAD=\\angle CBE=\\alpha$라 하면 $\\angle BAD=60^{\\circ}-\\alpha$이고, $\\angle ABE=60^{\\circ}+\\alpha$이다. 또 $\\angle DBE=70^{\\circ}$이므로 $\\angle ABD=\\alpha-10^{\\circ}$이다. 따라서 $\\triangle ABD$에서 $x=180^{\\circ}-(60^{\\circ}-\\alpha)-(\\alpha-10^{\\circ})=130^{\\circ}$이다. 따라서 정답은 ④이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_금당중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q20.png","exists":true,"sha256":"ebb287a16266f5b2cc314dd77fd20236fc997fb2c6260b17d0d8e8b76d5defae"}],"contentHash":"1e5615a1edcc36c757de5c8e677592a2e68e429277c0d69f139d9061793aba14","choicesHash":"752f47d357301c27af12d06a9e7a7b7c990871e7c25142582f32d361e5594afd","solutionHash":"d23d2a290b458911886a0251c7affc2c9c784be3b0d550122b27922fe8495dbd","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"e563c731a1a889d096b696b8623e9bab9f00ae324d6b89e3d16aab90f47a4a96"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_0e7ca2acc2e284db79f22c603bfdd6ff59d05ea407d20d8f882ba630661fd909","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_금당중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":22,"sourceQuestionNo":"22","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_금당중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#22","sourceFingerprint":"505d8bd4cf47e2c1789fdec9e46e45ea12eeed45a30c7e21a70510bf8bb8b457","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"795c0a0ca0e19e68d12caad9b5fedd08598bc25c9fe209e1738eb28d5d1a5256","content":"[서술형2] 다음 그림에서 $\\angle a$의 크기를 구하시오. (5점)","choices":[],"answer":"$63^{\\circ}$","solution":"두 대각선이 이루는 맞꼭지각의 크기는 같으므로 위쪽의 각은 $3x+36^{\\circ}$이다. 직선 위의 각의 합을 이용하면 $(2x-18)+(3x+36)+x=180$이다. 따라서 $6x+18=180$, $x=27$이다. 수직선과 수평선이 이루는 각은 직각이므로 $a+x=90$이고, $a=90-27=63^{\\circ}$이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_금당중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q22.png","exists":true,"sha256":"42dbd47d14656cea1dd50e5cd0d986ad90932c7cb06c1e96b6d009fbe27de0d2"}],"contentHash":"e4b84e014c0ec1f13ef6f5dbd5593194344fa9b78c07b455d7dfe938a0ef41b4","choicesHash":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","solutionHash":"fcd1e7a4407f7b8e058c219e89e8b6f7fc0456eb37384a8b36523e714cbbbee9","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-POSITION_RELATION","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"77d4cb9f15cc06f1f309fb06d36c12f89d1bd4c9d5424525a437d5d83c335c65"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_b0e72da851709131c0f398f5a65d94d8617d16cfbd9f859ccf075e2d864832fe","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_금당중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":23,"sourceQuestionNo":"23","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_금당중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#23","sourceFingerprint":"5b094163d035f02220c6d122ca0f2ebd3abc030619d75599741cb4bbe9b2ad1c","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"522a0a3e330ed4d6b81855a0a61fc4e3d0e4f8896d9371d50e7a467b49a745be","content":"[서술형3] 다음 그림에서 $\\overline{AB}\\perp\\overline{CO}$이고 $\\angle AOD=4\\angle COD$, $\\angle DOB=6\\angle DOE$일 때, $\\angle COE$의 크기를 구하시오. (5점)","choices":[],"answer":"$40^{\\circ}$","solution":"$\\angle COD=x$라 하면 $AB\\perp CO$이므로 $\\angle AOC=90^{\\circ}$이고 $\\angle AOD=90^{\\circ}+x$이다. $\\angle AOD=4\\angle COD$이므로 $90+x=4x$, $x=30$이다. 따라서 $\\angle AOD=120^{\\circ}$, $\\angle DOB=60^{\\circ}$이다. $\\angle DOB=6\\angle DOE$이므로 $\\angle DOE=10^{\\circ}$이다. 그러므로 $\\angle COE=30+10=40^{\\circ}$이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_금당중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q23.png","exists":true,"sha256":"24a6a34b9eae0438432e8b2614946d2519f45f4eb51a7cb3b7d0e2234d433492"}],"contentHash":"a4b88e5479d01dc0ed833ef4717ba4ee24ac2972d5e10a3a707e6ec26ffe3919","choicesHash":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","solutionHash":"3d460c9d67cc34a4fb0eb7897b6d632d55ea9322f8eb85f1061d36bea21e3b0b","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"411309a21dd21622e7c6a5fc109f583542764b3910fd29ebe4b6ed77f5a921ad"}
